{"game": "remnant-2", "language": "english", "appid": 1282100, "month": "2025-06", "window": 2, "start_date": 1749340800, "end_date": 1750031999, "month_true_total": 277, "quota": 5, "returned": 5, "pulled_at": "2026-09-12 14:56:39 Pacific Daylight Time", "reviews": [{"recommendationid": "197329068", "author": {"steamid": "76561198012626603", "personaname": "CosmicSpark", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/dragoon888/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 11, "playtime_forever": 4038, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 2429, "last_played": 1774326446, "avatar": "14fa45d90d1774068441651602af9b2de61890b4"}, "language": "english", "review": "Amazing FPS souls like to do alone or with co op LOTS of secrets to uncover", "timestamp_created": 1750017012, "timestamp_updated": 1750017012, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1690300800", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "197321897", "author": {"steamid": "76561198075044360", "personaname": "GoGo", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/Gogoman64/", "num_games_owned": 898, "num_reviews": 41, "playtime_forever": 2298, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 1136, "last_played": 1752263151, "avatar": "2816ac452c23b0b0798b1317253be5eccc9d4c0e"}, "language": "english", "review": "Fun dark souls style game play, well, gun play.\n\nsome awful secrets if you wanna 100% it. Fun if you ever figure it out naturally. \nSadly wiki isnt too amazing, but this game kinda is. \n\nGood smooth combat, fights, evades, you rarely feel animation locked or get ♥♥♥♥♥♥ over by creative bosses with undodagble attacks (cept one ♥♥♥♥♥♥♥♥ tongue grab)", "timestamp_created": 1750010689, "timestamp_updated": 1750010689, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1690300800", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "197321698", "author": {"steamid": "76561198025396102", "personaname": "Bessoten Jenny", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/planetrix15/", "num_games_owned": 506, "num_reviews": 18, "playtime_forever": 2715, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 2364, "last_played": 1754026830, "avatar": "738345e90541ec9e092fdad6321ae639eed49e4b"}, "language": "english", "review": "Coop is absolutely the best way to play this game and I really enjoy the boss rush mode. I do wish that it was a bit more transparent about how to complete quests and acquire certain items tho, you're gonna be playing this one with the wiki open on another monitor for sure.", "timestamp_created": 1750010524, "timestamp_updated": 1750010524, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1690300800", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "197321005", "author": {"steamid": "76561198005766837", "personaname": "Terranaut", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/Astark/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 301, "playtime_forever": 879, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 578, "last_played": 1750452455, "avatar": "472333b4f51f46018836dcaf22f0f122dc7e3e7e"}, "language": "english", "review": "Rather poorly designed.\nAlmost no hints to the secrets. Many enemies that you have no chance of fighting on your own.\nCharacters behave as if they are teenagers eternally locked in puberty.\nCoop experience is a joke - you do not see or hear the player's side of conversation with an NPC.\nSo if it is your first time talking with an NPC and someone else did it instead - good news, you missed the dialogue entirely.", "timestamp_created": 1750009868, "timestamp_updated": 1750018984, "voted_up": false, "votes_up": 1, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.456431567668914795", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1690300800", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "197317140", "author": {"steamid": "76561198047607001", "personaname": "Chocobro", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/slayr32119/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 443, "playtime_forever": 3215, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 3215, "last_played": 1749599585, "avatar": "c1e7e0ec5b20617401e87edea44ead18f2b47f7d"}, "language": "english", "review": "A damn fine game on its own when you ignore the story in its entirety. The lore on the other hand is leagues better, and the possibilities in worlds and interconnected secrets make replaying a snap. Especially in coop.\r\n\r\nMassive downside that folk should be aware about. The impossible to know secrets, classes, and otherwise that you'd have to LITERALLY datamine the instructions for, or be a part of the discord during x amount of years. Run the game blind, and then if you like it, pull up the wiki for completionist sake before you reroll the campaign. It may save you alot of heart ache.", "timestamp_created": 1750006509, "timestamp_updated": 1750006509, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1690300800", "reactions": []}]}